*get* | V-$CHIPVR ($CHIPCN)

''get(container, index)''

Gets an element from a list or bytes at the specified index.

*Parameters:*
- ''container'': List or bytes
- ''index'': Number index position

*Returns:*
- Any: Element value from list at index
- Number: Byte value (0-255) from bytes at index

*Errors:*
- Runtime error if container is not list or bytes
- Runtime error if index is not a number
- Runtime error if index is out of bounds
